BSP-Yocto-NXP-i.MX8MP-PD22.1.2            2023-08-06
====================================================

- Linux NXP Vendor Kernel v5.10.72_2.2.0-phy18 (based on NXP tag lf-5.10.72-2.2.0)
- Linux NXP Vendor Kernel with Preempt-RT v5.10.72_2.2.0-rt54-phy11
  (based on NXP tag lf-5.10.72-2.2.0 and 5.10.73_rt54 rt patch stack)
- U-boot v2021.04_2.2.0-phy17 (based on NXP tag lf-5.10.72-2.2.0)
